  (text "Bias supply: silicon diode off an AC tap, 1 k/4.7 k dropping through the choke, 27 k bleeder, dual 25/50 uF can -> -54 V." (at 219.59 312.005 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "3d449d5f-943f-5fa1-9f2b-7a4be89d5be0"))
  (text "The 56 kΩ speaker feedback returns to the same foot node, so it is a second DC path to ground through the output transformer's secondary." (at 12.7 390.783 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "e2c4aa5d-02a6-577b-b094-655b89a67c5e"))
  (text "Power — universal power transformer (TR1, 125P7A), centre-tapped HT winding; two 3-diode series legs form a silicon full-wave bridge (no rectifier tube); 20 uF/600V filters either side of the choke (TR2, 125C1A); 4.7 k/1 W and 27 k/1 W droppers feed the driver and preamp taps." (at 12.7 395.183 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "66169696-1648-552b-ae07-90e250399f69"))
  (text "Two full channels (Bass, Normal), each two preamp stages with its own Bass/Treble/Volume tone network, mixing at a shared driver bottle ahead of a long-tailed-pair phase inverter and a fixed-bias 5881 pair off a solid-state bridge — no rectifier tube." (at 12.7 399.583 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "2e7afd2c-1d3e-5412-b17d-7537a315c419"))
  (text "The Bass channel's own Treble control sits inside the driver bottle's signal path (V3A -> VR6 -> V3B), not beside its Bass/Volume pots. Heaters, PT primary, ground switch, fuse and standby switch omitted." (at 12.7 403.983 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "ce625258-973d-5dcb-87cc-1248e2951683"))
